        "list": [
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: n = 10\nOutput: 4\nExplanation: There are four good numbers in the range [1, 10] : 2, 5, 6, 9.\nNote that 1 and 10 are not good numbers, since they remain unchanged after rotating.\n```"
